ing out and where  we can keep up to date it's coming out  in 2023 on pc and console on xbox game  pass  and if you want to know more just follow  us twitter or you know jump on  minecraft.net uh dennis i'm so excited  to jump into minecraft legends thank you  so much for stopping by and giving us  the lowdown oh thanks for having me  you
 

